stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> registered: Register (write descriptor)
  registered --> initializing: CodeBuild deploy succeeded → Check initialization
  initializing --> active: all component probes passed → Enable
  active --> draining: Stop accepting work
  draining --> decommissioning: approval granted → destroy build
  decommissioning --> deleted: stacks deleted (data buckets / table bucket / snapshots retained)
  registered --> failed: build failed
  initializing --> failed: probe failed
  failed --> registered: Redeploy
